    {
      "id": "u_9b2288f09e6b3c4a61040ef9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Active content__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is a generic name for powerful features in Trilium, these range from customizing the UI to advanced scripting that can alter your notes or even your PC.",
      "sourceHash": "9b2288f09e6b3c4a61040ef92d36f34ba74eff39fd72e8f93480df6d1bb11fe8",
      "context": "Active content",
      "contextHash": "2cdc2b65de379935b8bba5f30ea245f470b1bffc652990562774c9f70e3948a4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bc228d5dd49ca312b8ce623a_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Safe import__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "bc228d5dd49ca312b8ce623a443f90a453b9c6a05269256f9c5606673232ccd5",
      "context": "Active content > Safe import",
      "contextHash": "b95c9a963bba0cef10d0d170d09c05b237011bb2a763c96a7814fc43f4a30345",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cfe8adec3ce75e517507dc12_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Active content problem of safety, especially when this active content comes from a third-party such as if it is downloaded from a website and then imported into Trilium.",
      "sourceHash": "cfe8adec3ce75e517507dc1212dab7c1572e1c72d8e9c7a86f9cc6563411e7cf",
      "context": "Active content > Safe import",
      "contextHash": "b95c9a963bba0cef10d0d170d09c05b237011bb2a763c96a7814fc43f4a30345",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_309939435c828f786e5b9649_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When __TRILIUM_PH_0__importing__TRILIUM_PH_1__ into Trilium, __TRILIUM_PH_2__safe mode__TRILIUM_PH_3__ is active by default which will try to prevent untrusted code from executing. For example, a __TRILIUM_PH_4__custom widget__TRILIUM_PH_5__ needs the __TRILIUM_PH_6__ __TRILIUM_PH_7__label__TRILIUM_PH_8__ in order to function; safe import works by renaming that label to __TRILIUM_PH_9__.",
      "sourceHash": "309939435c828f786e5b96493198ae30d326c3c000b7cdd509f698bcd88e0198",
      "context": "Active content > Safe import",
      "contextHash": "b95c9a963bba0cef10d0d170d09c05b237011bb2a763c96a7814fc43f4a30345",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_05b50bba2940b42d770c85de_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This applies to every attribute an import creates: those in a Trilium .zip export, and those made from the properties of other formats (such as the YAML front matter of a Markdown file, an Evernote tag, or a Notion, Anytype or Obsidian property).",
      "sourceHash": "05b50bba2940b42d770c85de0442f195dc9a424384cbbbb8d6d72a32490ca25f",
      "context": "Active content > Safe import",
      "contextHash": "b95c9a963bba0cef10d0d170d09c05b237011bb2a763c96a7814fc43f4a30345",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_addc01a98074b4d4102b3a39_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Safe mode__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "addc01a98074b4d4102b3a39f427b43f8825c94be87382832667547745ee4a10",
